{"session_id": "20260906T194343Z-0f533f", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:45:30+00:00", "language": "ta", "input_mode": "voice", "query": "What are the agri schemes in Tamil Nadu? What are their benefits?", "translated_query": "What are the agri schemes in Tamil Nadu? What are their benefits?", "answer": "தமிழ்நாட்டில் உள்ள விவசாயத் திட்டங்களில் விதை உற்பத்தி உதவி மற்றும் விவசாய இயந்திரமயமாக்கல் திட்டம் ஆகியவை அடங்கும். விவசாய இயந்திரங்களை வாங்க மானியம் வழங்கப்படுகிறது. மேலும், நெல் விதை பெருக்கத் திட்டத்தின் மூலம் தரமான விதைகளை உற்பத்தி செய்யும் விவசாயிகளுக்கு ஊக்கத்தொகை வழங்கப்படுகிறது.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0000", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.9974468760506369}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0018", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "Agricultural Mechanisation Programme", "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.734374189616613}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0046", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "Rashtriya Krishi Vikas Yojana", "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.3064872627933035}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0054", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.2215064678978084}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0008", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "National Food Securit