{"session_id": "20260906T194343Z-0f533f", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:48:49+00:00", "language": "en", "input_mode": "voice", "query": "Say, okay, what are the schemes that the central government provides to farmers? List them, those schemes, and let me check.", "translated_query": "Central Government schemes for farmers list?", "answer": "The central government provides Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana to insure crops against natural disasters, and Minikit Programme for Rice to boost yields using high-yielding varieties. It also runs Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchayee Yojana to bring water to every farm and use it efficiently. For more details on any of these, please ask about a specific scheme.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0019", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.9921270634261516}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0066", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "Minikit Programme for Rice", "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.9570199090205659}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0008", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.9558656866854002}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0009", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchayee Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "p