{"session_id": "20260906T194343Z-0f533f", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:49:36+00:00", "language": "en", "input_mode": "voice", "query": "Tell me about Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana.", "translated_query": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana details Central Government farmers", "answer": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana protects you if a natural disaster destroys your crop. The premium is low, at 2% for Kharif crops and 1.5% for Rabi crops, with the Central and State governments paying the balance. It also supports sustainable agriculture and stabilizes your farm income. Ask about a specific scheme for more details.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0019", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.9983508184721279}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0025", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana", "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\SCHEMES.pdf", "source_url": null, "page_number": 10, "rerank_score": 0.9768359095675583}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0009", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchayee Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.9701806861947286}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0040", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Minimum Support Price", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.938655962673682}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0727", "doc_i